{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.helium4_amplification_gt_130","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.helium4_amplification_gt_130","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-error-amplification.lean#L39-L45","doc":"The amplification factor `M_atom / B` for ⁴He exceeds 130, in the\ncross-multiplied form `130 · B_AME < M_atom` with bound mass\n`M_atom ≈ 3727.379 MeV` and `B_AME ≈ 28.296 MeV` (CODATA / AME-2020).\nA `0.7 %` bound-mass error therefore becomes a `~90 %` binding error.\nThe ratio itself carries no framework assumption. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.binding_rel_error","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.binding_rel_error","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-error-amplification.lean#L25-L37","doc":"**Binding-energy error amplification.**  With binding defined as the mass\ndefect `B = M_free − M_atom`, and the predicted bound mass carrying\nrelative error `δ` (`M_atom_pred = M_atom·(1 + δ)`, exact `M_free`), the\npredicted binding `B_pred = M_free − M_atom_pred` has relative error\n\n  `(B_pred − B) / B = −δ · (M_atom / B)`.\n\nThe amplification factor is the mass-to-binding ratio `M_atom / B`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:binding-error-amplification","label":"prop:binding-error-amplification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-error-amplification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.amplification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BindingErrorAmplification.amplification","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-error-amplification.lean#L22-L23","doc":"The amplification factor: bound-state mass over binding energy. ","signatureChunk":0}]}